OL,3,GNEWSAUninsured driver jailed for
OL,4,Akilling woman
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn uninsured driver who killed a young
OL,7,Fwoman and seriously injured her friend
OL,8,Fwhen he lost control of his car and
OL,9,Fmounted the pavement has been jailed.
OL,11,FNatasha Thorp, who was 21, was walking
OL,12,Fon Brassington Avenue, Sutton
OL,13,FColdfield, on 22 August 2025 when she
OL,14,Fwas hit by the car and died at the
OL,15,Fscene.
OL,17,FHer friend suffered serious leg
OL,18,Finjuries when they were struck just
OL,19,Fbefore midnight by the Toyota Corolla
OL,20,Fbeing driven by 20-year-old Saleh
OL,21,FHassan.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
