OL,3,GNEWSAUninsured driver jailed for
OL,4,Akilling woman
OL,5,
OL,6,FHassan admitted to causing death by
OL,7,Fdangerous driving, causing serious
OL,8,Finjury by dangerous driving and causing
OL,9,Fdeath while uninsured. On Friday, he
OL,10,Fwas jailed for nine years and four
OL,11,Fmonths at Birmingham Crown Court.
